.TH clean 1 0.1.2 https://github.com/dbowm91/cargo-cleanme "General Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
clean \- Preview or execute cleanup of revalidated Cargo build artifacts
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBclean\fR [\fB\-\-known\fR] [\fB\-\-full\fR] [\fB\-\-min\-reclaimable\-bytes\fR] [\fB\-\-older\-than\fR] [\fB\-\-include\fR] [\fB\-\-exclude\fR] [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-\-package\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-dryrun\fR] [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fIROOT\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Preview or execute cleanup of revalidated Cargo build artifacts
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-known\fR
Clean bounded roots selected by the current Routine policy
.TP
\fB\-\-full\fR
Complete Full reconciliation before cleaning its learned roots
.TP
\fB\-\-min\-reclaimable\-bytes\fR \fI<MIN_RECLAIMABLE_BYTES>\fR
Require at least this many reclaimable bytes per workspace
.TP
\fB\-\-older\-than\fR \fI<OLDER_THAN>\fR
Require this many seconds of inactivity
.TP
\fB\-\-include\fR \fI<INCLUDE>\fR
Include canonical workspace roots matching this glob (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-exclude\fR \fI<EXCLUDE>\fR
Exclude canonical workspace roots matching this glob (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR
Ask Cargo to clean one named profile. Selector byte estimates are unknown
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<PACKAGE>\fR
Clean one validated workspace package through qualified Cargo versions
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Cargo preview: invoke Cargo\*(Aqs own dry\-run (the default mode). Distinct from `\-\-dryrun` (cargo\-cleanme simulation)
.TP
\fB\-\-dryrun\fR
Application simulation: run the full decision/progress/report path but invoke no Cargo clean command. Distinct from `\-\-dry\-run`
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR
Execute Cargo clean after per\-workspace revalidation
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fIROOT\fR]
Optional bounded sandbox root. Omit with \-\-known or \-\-full
